Withdraw_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when assets zero
│  └── it should revert with InvalidAmount
└── when assets non zero
   ├── when market not allowlisted for vault
   │  └── it should revert with MarketNotAllowed
   └── when market allowlisted
      ├── given idToMarketParams returns zero loanToken
      │  └── it should revert with UnknownMarket
      └── given known market
         ├── given Morpho not authorized for adapter on behalf of vault
         │  └── it should revert in Morpho with not authorized
         └── given Morpho authorized
            ├── given assets exceeds vault supply position
            │  └── it should revert in Morpho
            └── given assets within vault position
               ├── it should call morpho.withdraw with onBehalf equal to vault
               ├── it should call morpho.withdraw with receiver equal to vault
               ├── it should transfer loan token to vault
               └── it should return non zero (assetsWithdrawn, sharesBurned)
